== Notes ==
*The shapes available with this spell are somewhat limited compared to [[shifter]] forms or the actual creatures. For example, the red dragon shape does not have [[fire dragon breath]] nor an [[aura of dragon fear]] (c.f [[adult red dragon]]). This is especially true if you have powerful equipment, as the Shifter forms merge in some equipment to your new form, while these do not - all of your equipment is disabled while polymorphed, and re-enabled once it expires.
*Casting this spell disables spellcasting and item use except potions; see [[polymorph]] for details.
*The AC bonus is a [[dodge bonus]].

